Documentation and user experience:
- README.md provides clear installation and setup instructions (User Experience, Documentation acceptance criteria):
  - Installation section with npm/yarn commands.
  - Example ESLint v9 flat-config usage:
    ```js
    import js from "@eslint/js";
    import traceability from "eslint-plugin-traceability";

    export default [
      js.configs.recommended,
      {
        plugins: {
          traceability,
        },
      },
      ...traceability.configs.recommended,
    ];
    ```
