NPM package structure:
- package.json:
  - "name": "eslint-plugin-traceability" (standard ESLint plugin naming convention).
  - "main": "lib/src/index.js", "types": "lib/src/index.d.ts", "files": ["lib", "README.md", ...] – suitable for npm publishing (REQ-NPM-PACKAGE).
  - peerDependencies: { "eslint": "^9.0.0" } – explicitly targeting ESLint v9.
  - devDependencies include TypeScript, ESLint 9, Jest, ts-jest, @typescript-eslint/parser/utils, aligning with TS-based plugin best practice (REQ-TYPESCRIPT, REQ-TEST-SETUP).

